{"id":"617923ff5edce923","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-preservation-chain.md","title":"Chain Preservation Theorem","display":"thm-preservation-chain — Chain Preservation Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-preservation-chain","aliases":["57-thm-preservation-chain"],"display":"thm-preservation-chain — Chain Preservation Theorem","depends_on":["[[57-df-maxcon]]","[[57-df-sentence]]","[[57-df-quantifier-free]]","[[57-df-free-variable]]","[[57-df-substructure]]","[[57-df-logical-equivalence]]","[[57-thm-preservation-union-chains]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-preservation-chain"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-preservation-chain</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-preservation-chain — Chain Preservation Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e892c7a9bb01feb5\" href=\"?note=e892c7a9bb01feb5\" title=\"57-df-maxcon\">57-df-maxcon</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"38cb16fd577caf7b\" href=\"?note=38cb16fd577caf7b\" title=\"57-df-sentence\">57-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6e2653d41c62cb0e\" href=\"?note=6e2653d41c62cb0e\" title=\"57-df-quantifier-free\">57-df-quantifier-free</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f2434afaa125d50e\" href=\"?note=f2434afaa125d50e\" title=\"57-df-free-variable\">57-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"90dc104b21b5c21e\" href=\"?note=90dc104b21b5c21e\" title=\"57-df-substructure\">57-df-substructure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c89ee0e6bffc3470\" href=\"?note=c89ee0e6bffc3470\" title=\"57-df-logical-equivalence\">57-df-logical-equivalence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b73b77ae86e33532\" href=\"?note=b73b77ae86e33532\" title=\"57-thm-preservation-union-chains\">57-thm-preservation-union-chains</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为一阶字母表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QFree}\">\\(\\mathrm{QFree}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}\\)</span>、结构并、子结构和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv\">\\(\\equiv\\)</span> 见依赖文件。下式中变量块有限且块内及块间变量互异；空块允许。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\forall_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> 在本条目中显式指定为全称—存在句子类，不与全称句子类混同。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 是背景集合论中的冯·诺伊曼序数类，链指标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 取其非零元素；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ChainPreserved}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{ChainPreserved}(\\varphi)\\)</span> 是下式对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> 定义的链并保持谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\coloneqq\\{\\forall x_1\\cdots\\forall x_m\\exists y_1\\cdots\\exists y_n\\theta:m,n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\mathrm{QFree}(\\theta),\\ (x_1,\\ldots,x_m,y_1,\\ldots,y_n)\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{m+n},\\ |\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_m,y_1,\\ldots,y_n\\}|=m+n,\\ \\mathrm{FV}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_m,y_1,\\ldots,y_n\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\coloneqq\\{\\forall x_1\\cdots\\forall x_m\\exists y_1\\cdots\\exists y_n\\theta:m,n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\mathrm{QFree}(\\theta),\\ (x_1,\\ldots,x_m,y_1,\\ldots,y_n)\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{m+n},\\ |\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_m,y_1,\\ldots,y_n\\}|=m+n,\\ \\mathrm{FV}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_m,y_1,\\ldots,y_n\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ChainPreserved}(\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i&lt;\\alpha}\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S^{\\alpha}\\;\\left[\\left(\\forall i&lt;\\alpha\\;\\mathfrak A_i\\models\\varphi\\right)\\land\\left(\\forall i&lt;j&lt;\\alpha\\;\\mathfrak A_i\\subseteq\\mathfrak A_j\\right)\\to\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\alpha}\\mathfrak A_i\\models\\varphi\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ChainPreserved}(\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i&lt;\\alpha}\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S^{\\alpha}\\;\\left[\\left(\\forall i&lt;\\alpha\\;\\mathfrak A_i\\models\\varphi\\right)\\land\\left(\\forall i&lt;j&lt;\\alpha\\;\\mathfrak A_i\\subseteq\\mathfrak A_j\\right)\\to\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\alpha}\\mathfrak A_i\\models\\varphi\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ChainPreserved}(\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\psi\\in\\forall_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;(\\varphi\\equiv\\psi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ChainPreserved}(\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\psi\\in\\forall_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;(\\varphi\\equiv\\psi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>链保持使用任意非空子结构链，而非仅初等链；对应 ∀∃ 句子，不是任意未经定义的“∀₁”自然语言约定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[H